d loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052300/extras/f3fc3a46b011c82f06cd0e2676d1fbfb.poster.avif?t=1752826151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052300/extras/f3fc3a46b011c82f06cd0e2676d1fbfb.webm?t=1752826151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052300/extras/f3fc3a46b011c82f06cd0e2676d1fbfb.mp4?t=1752826151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Glaciered supports NVIDIA RTX features. Experience the far-future Earth in 4K, enhanced by ray-tracing and DLSS, with 8K textures used for the main characters.",
